    "detailed_description": "By default, the safe is locked with a digital code. Your task is to collect all digital codes to solve the puzzle and when all the codes are collected then the safe will be opened to get its contents. To pick up a digital code for the safe, you need to move, teleport and combinatory the digital blocks together, at the same time take into account gravity and time bombs that can destroy walls. If you make a mistake when solving a puzzle, you can try again. Remember that the number of attempts to collect a digital code and time is limited.<br />\r\nThe game supports two save modes by checkpoints or passed levels. <br />\r\nThe complete game distribution includes 60 levels.",
